com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/54.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-03T22:00:13Z"},"body":"Addresses issue #43 without closing it.\n\nThis enables overflow checks for the workspace release profile and adds a release-mode regression that requires a runtime usize overflow to panic. The standard check target now runs that regression.\n\nChecked-release boot testing exposed two eager rejected-branch underflows, which now use lazy conditional evaluation. The larger checked binaries also required bounded capacity updates: the root image publication limit is 164 pages, and the network image uses a canonical 161-page capacity shared by its loader and validator.\n\nVerification:\n- make check\n- make test\n- make test-qemu-smoke\n- post-change EFI 70,135,296 bytes, +72,192 bytes or about 0.103%\n- final cached smoke 9.54 seconds versus 9.22-second coarse baseline\n\nPlease keep issue #43 open until maintainer review. This PR does not merge or close anything.","closed_by":{"login":"gmkurtzer","id":13984965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/54/reactions","to